  "— run history saved in the browser, CSV export, and a per-run balance check.": "— Duerchlafhistorique am Browser gespäichert, CSV-Export an e Saldo-Check pro Duerchlaf.",
  "Creates a test SPL token, mints {0} to your account, and opens an escrow and a recipient account. Two wallet prompts. Needed once before running the flow.": "Mécht en SPL-Test-Token, prägt {0} op Äre Kont a mécht en Escrow-Kont an en Empfänger-Kont op. Zwou Portemonnaie-Ufroen. Eemol néideg, ier de Flow leeft.",
