  "Force a step to fail, to demonstrate compensation.": "Léisst e Schrëtt gezielt feelschloen, fir d'Kompensatioun ze weisen.",
  "Flow ID:": "Flow-ID:",
  "Every saved run, with signatures, balances and a balance check. Saved in this browser only and kept after a refresh. Downloads are in English: a text log or a CSV spreadsheet.": "All gespäichert Duerchlaf, mat Ënnerschrëften, Saldoen an engem Saldo-Check. Nëmmen an dësem Browser gespäichert a bleift no engem Neiluede bestoen. D'Downloads sinn op Englesch: en Textlog oder eng CSV-Tabell.",
  "No Phantom wallet detected. Install the Phantom extension and switch it to Devnet.": "Keng Phantom-Portemonnaie fonnt. Installéiert d'Phantom-Extensioun a setzt se op Devnet.",
