  "Creating token and accounts — the wallet will prompt twice…": "Token a Konte ginn ugeluecht — de Portemonnaie freet zweemol…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for setup. Request more at faucet.solana.com (setup needs about 0.02 SOL).": "Net genuch Devnet-SOL fir de Setup. Freet méi op faucet.solana.com (de Setup brauch ongeféier 0.02 SOL).",
