  "TOKEN ACCOUNTS": "TOKEN-KONTEN",
  "Real SPL token accounts on Solana devnet. Balances update after every run. Each flow moves {0} tokens.": "Echt SPL-Token-Konten op Solana devnet. D'Saldoe ginn no all Duerchlaf aktualiséiert. All Flow beweegt {0} Tokens.",
