  "PAY": "BEZUELEN",
  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Maacht an dräi Schrëtt eng Bezuelungsuerder: Wielt Service a Betrag, wielt wéi Dir bezuele wëllt, a kritt déi genee Bezuelungsdetailer mat Ärer Bestellnummer.",
