  "Currency": "Wärung",
  "Deposit and milestone percentages are set in your written agreement — use the split that matches your quote.": "Acompte- an Etappeprozenter sinn an Ärem schrëftleche Kontrakt festgeluecht — benotzt d'Opdeelung, déi zu Ärer Offer passt.",
  "Customer service (optional)": "Clientsservice (fakultativ)",
  "If one of our customer service staff assisted you, type their name here so we can credit them.": "Wann Iech een aus eisem Clientsservice gehollef huet, schreift hei säin Numm, fir datt mir him dat kënnen ugerechnen.",
