  "02 — PAYMENT METHOD": "02 — BEZUELMETHOD",
  "Interac e-Transfer is available in CAD only. Switch the currency to CAD to use it.": "Interac e-Transfer ass just a CAD disponibel. Setzt d'Wärung op CAD fir en ze benotzen.",
  "03 — GENERATE ORDER": "03 — BESTELLUNG MAACHEN",
